          "name": "Calls add (executable, not auto-executable) - approved run is not denied",
          "description": "Regression for PR #5766 review 4083464953: tools_to_auto_execute means 'needs approval', never 'denied'. A call through /v1/mcp/tool/execute is the approved path.",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var code = pm.response.code;",
                  "pm.test('status is 200', function () {",
